---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import GoogleAnalytics from "../components/GoogleAnalytics.astro";
import CookieConsent from "../components/CookieConsent.astro";

---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <GoogleAnalytics />
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>ERSSOFT Content Social | TikTok Integration</title>

  <!-- Theme & Icons -->
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/assets/favicon-16x16.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png">

  <!-- SEO -->
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Information about ERSSOFT Content Social and its TikTok Login Kit and Content Posting API integration."
  />

  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />

  <link
    rel="canonical"
    href="https://www.erssoft.co.uk/tiktok-review/"
  />

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/common.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tiktok-review.css">
</head>

<body>

<Header />
<div class="page-content">

<main>

  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">
      Social Media Publishing
    </p>

    <h1>
      ERSSOFT Content Social
    </h1>

    <p>
      ERSSOFT Content Social is a web-based content management
      and social publishing application developed by ErsSoft Limited
      for authorized business managers.
    </p>

    <p>
      The application allows business managers to create, manage
      and publish social media content from one central platform.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Social Media Publishing</h2>

      <p>
        Business managers can create and manage social media posts
        containing text, photos and videos, depending on the
        capabilities supported by each connected social media
        platform.
      </p>

      <p>
        ERSSOFT Content Social currently provides integrations for
        multiple social media platforms.
      </p>

      <div class="platforms">
        <span class="platform">Facebook</span>
        <span class="platform">Instagram</span>
        <span class="platform">TikTok</span>
        <span class="platform">LinkedIn</span>
        <span class="platform">X</span>
        <span class="platform">YouTube</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="card tiktok-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        TikTok Integration
      </p>

      <h2>TikTok Content Publishing</h2>

      <p>
        Authorized business managers can securely connect their
        TikTok account to ERSSOFT Content Social using TikTok
        Login Kit.
      </p>

      <p>
        ERSSOFT Content Social uses the TikTok Content Posting API
        to allow an authorized user to publish supported content
        directly to their connected TikTok account.
      </p>

      <p>
        Using Direct Post, the manager selects the content to
        publish, enters the post text, chooses an available TikTok
        privacy option and starts the publishing process.
      </p>

      <p>
        Publishing is initiated by the authorized user. ERSSOFT
        Content Social does not publish content to a TikTok account
        without the user's authorization and publishing action.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>TikTok Permissions</h2>

      <p>
        The TikTok integration uses permissions required for account
        connection and content publishing.
      </p>

      <ul class="scope-list">
        <li>
          <strong>user.info.basic</strong> –
          used to identify the authorized TikTok account and display
          basic account connection information.
        </li>

        <li>
          <strong>video.publish</strong> –
          used for Direct Post publishing to the authorized TikTok
          account.
        </li>

        <li>
          <strong>video.upload</strong> –
          used as part of the TikTok Content Posting API integration.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>User Control</h2>

      <p>
        Content is prepared and reviewed by the authorized business
        manager before publishing.
      </p>

      <p>
        The user chooses the content, publishing platform and
        available publishing options before starting the publishing
        action.
      </p>

      <p>
        TikTok publishing is performed only for a TikTok account
        that has been connected and authorized by the user.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Secure Management Access</h2>

      <p>
        The ERSSOFT Content Social management application is
        restricted to authorized business users and requires secure
        sign-in.
      </p>

      <p>
        This public information page is provided so platform
        reviewers and visitors can understand the purpose and
        functionality of ERSSOFT Content Social without requiring
        access to a business management account.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

</div>
<Footer />
<CookieConsent />

</body>
</html>